2026-11-06T03:18:56.1301637Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1302069Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1302571Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1302892Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1303413Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1303830Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1315429Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1316041Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1326523Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1327167Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1327493Z 
2026-11-06T03:18:56.1328290Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
